{"symbol":"MXC.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T23:08:03Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Towarowa 23a","city":"Tychy","zip":"43-100","country":"Poland","phone":"48 32 327 7089","fax":"48 32 327 7860","website":"https://maxcom.pl","industry":"Consumer Electronics","industryKey":"consumer-electronics","industryDisp":"Consumer Electronics","sector":"Technology","sectorKey":"technology","sectorDisp":"Technology","longBusinessSummary":"Maxcom S.A., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the production and distribution of consumer electronics products in Poland, Europe, and internationally. It offers phones and smartphones; smartwatches and sports bands; smart rings; payment devices; televisions; GSM accessories, including batteries, cases, protective foils, USB cables, and headsets; laptops; audio devices, such as walkies-talkies, headphones, and wireless speakers; photovoltaic products comprising small household appliances, cleaning robots and accessories, desk lamps and touch light switches, and intelligent thermostatic heads; scooters and electric bicycle drives; car audio; electronic translators; and other products. The company also provides warranty and post-warranty; transport; and rental services. It sells its products under the Aiwa, BijouWatch, Dirt Devil, Ecowatch, Fanttik, Fossibot, Kospet, Lenovo, Motorola, and NowGo brand names. The company was formerly known as Maxcom Spólka z o.o. and changed its name to Maxcom S.A. in February 2012. Maxcom S.A. was incorporated in 2012 and is headquartered in Tychy, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":49,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Arkadiusz  Wilusz","age":58,"title":"President of Management Board","yearBorn":1967,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Andrzej  Wilusz","age":49,"title":"Vice President of Management Board","yearBorn":1976,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Aleksander  Wilusz","age":33,"title":"Member of the Management Board & CTO","year